  "historyNote": "#6889, eff 11-21-98; EXPIRED: 11-21-06 New. #8767, INTERIM, eff 11-22-06, EXPIRED: 5-21-07 New. #8893, eff 6-5-07 (from Fis 802.06), EXPIRED: 6-5-15 New. #10868, INTERIM, eff 6-25-15, , EXPIRED: 12-22-15 New. #11029, eff 1-26-16; ss by #14558, eff 4-21-26, EXPIRES: 4-21-36",
